  "verseCount": 55,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe alandile kuli Mose pa lupili lwa Sinai ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eba abena Israeli nokutila kuli bena, ‘Ilyo mukengila mu calo ico ndepeela kuli imwe, icalo conse cifwile ukutuusha mukusunga Isabata lyakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa myaka mutanda mulebyala imbuto mu mabala yenu. Kabili pa myaka mutanda ine, mufwile ukutungwila ifimuti fya myangashi mu mabala yenu no kusombola ifisabo fyenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo mu mwaka walenga cine lubali, icalo cifwile ukukwata ukutuusha umwaka onse uwe Sabata, nge Sabata lyakwa Yawe. Tecakwesha ukubyala amabala yenu, nangufye ukutungwila ifimuti fya myangashi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tecakwesha no kusombola icintu nelyo cimo icikaimenenafye icine, nangu ukulobolola imyangashi iyo mushatungwilile. Pantu ukaba mwaka wakutuusha kwa mpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Conse icaimenena mu mabala yenu mu mwaka wakutuusha uwe Sabata, ecikaba icilyo cenu bonse, ababomfi benu abaume na babomfi benu abanakashi, na ku babomfi bamalipilo, pamo pene na ku mweni uo mwikala nankwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili na ku fitekwa fyenu fine pamo pene na ku nama sha mu mpanga yenu, conse icikafuma muli iyi mpanga ecikaba icakulya cenu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aeba Mose ati, “Ukalependa Amasabata cine lubali aya myaka, emukutila imyaka cine lubali imiku cine lubali, epakuti amasabata cine lubali yakalingane ne myaka amakumi yane na pabula (49). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyena ubushiku bwalenga ikumi mu mweshi walenga cine lubali, mukalishe ipenga, likomfwike konse konse. Pa bushiku ubu ubwakufuta pa fyabubifi, mukalishe ipenga mpangafye yonse mu calo cenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukaleshisha umwaka walenga amakumi yasano no kulashimikila icebo cakulubuka mu calofye conse ku bekashi abekalamo. Uyu uli nokuba e mwaka wakusefya kuli imwe. Onsefye umuntu ali nokubwelelamo ku mpanga ya fikolwe fyakwe kabili na ku lupwa lwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwaka walenga amakumi yasano kuli imwe wakusefya. Muli uyu mwaka tecakwesha ukubyalamo nangu ukusombola fyonse ifilyo ifyaimenena ifine, nangu ukusaba ku myangashi mushatungwilile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu umwaka walenga amakumi yasano uwakusefya, mwaka wamushilo kuli imwe. Mufwile ukulyafye ifisabo ifili nokufuma mu mabala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muli uyu mwaka wakusefya, umuntu onsefye ali nokubwelelamo ku mpanga ya fikolwe fyakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga cakutila washita impanga ku mwikalacalo munobe, nangu washitisha kuli ena, tecakwesha ukufyengana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uli nokushita iyi mpanga ku mubiyo pakumona imyaka yapitapo ilyo umwaka walenga amakumi yasano uwakusefya wapitile. Kabili ali nokushitisha iyi mpanga pakumona imyaka iyashalako iyakulobololamo ifisabo mu mabala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cakuti imyaka yashalako ingi, ufwile lyena walundako umutengo. Kabili nge myaka yashalako inono, ufwile nalyo line ukucefyako umutengo, pantu icintu ico uyu muntu alekushitisha te mpanga iyoo, lelo fisabo ifyo akakushamo pa myaka yashalako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tecakwesha ukulafyengana, lelo mulekwata akatiina kuli Lesa wenu. Nine Yawe Lesa wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mulingile ukukonka amafunde yandi no kusakamana ukubeela ifipope fyandi fyonse, lyena elyo mukekala umutelelwe mu calo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No mushili wabamo ukalatwala ifitwalo fisuma, mukalalya no kwikuta kabili mukalaikala umutelelwe mu calo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Limo kuti mwaipusha, ‘Nga tukalalya nshi muli uyu mwaka walenga cine lubali, nga cakutila tatubyele mbuto nangu ukulobolola ifisabo?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine, ne Yawe, nkapaala icalo ici pa myaka mutanda pakuti cikakwate ifilyo ifingi pa myaka itatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo mukalabyala ifisabo mu mwaka walenga cine konse konse, mukalalya ifyo mwasombwele mu mwaka walenga mutanda, mpakafye ilyo mukakwata ukulobolola mu mwaka walenga pabula.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Yawe aeba Mose ati, “Tecakwesha ukushitisha impanga ukuba iya umbi pe, pantu iyi mpanga yandi, imwe mulifye abeni abasuminishiwa ukwikalamofye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Impanga yonse iyo mwapeelwa nge cikwatwa, mufwile ukupekanya ifyakulubula iyi mpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cakuti umwina Israeli munenu umo aba umulanda elyo ashitishako impanga yakwe, uwa mu lupwa uupaleme afwile aisa lubula iyi mpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cakuti nalimo takwetepo nelyo umo uwakumwafwilisha mukulubula iyi mpanga, lelo umwine eka nga aisa ba ne cuma icakuti ailubwilamo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ali nokupenda imyaka iyo impanga yali nokushala mu minwe ya washitile. Kabili ali nokulipila indalama ukulingana ne myaka iyashala ku mwaka wakusefya. Awe lyena uyu uwali e mwine wa mpanga kale, kuti abwelela mu mpanga yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo nga cakuti, takwete ifyuma fyakulubwilamo impanga iyi, awe ili nokubafye mu minwe ya uyu wine muntu uwaishitile mpaka umwaka walenga amakumi yasano wakusefya ukafike. Impanga ili nokubwelela ku mwine mu mwakafye wakusefya, elyo uyu muntu uwashitishe akabwelela mu mpanga yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga cakuti umuntu ashitisha iŋanda iyaba mwilinga lya musumba, ali nokukwata insambu yakuilubula umwaka umo uutuntulu nga wapwa ukufuma apo aishitishishe. Mu nshita ilya ine, lyena kuti alubula iyi ŋanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba nga cakuti talubwile iyi ŋanda, ilyo uyu mwaka utuntulu taulapita, iyi ŋanda iyaba mwilinga lya musumba ili nokuba nomba iyakwa kashita no lupwa lwakwe umukakonkanina inkulo, ninshi capwa. Tali nakuibwesesha ku mwine nangufye umwaka walenga amakumi yasano uwakusefya ukafike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo amayanda aya mu mishi ukushashinguluka amalinga, yena yali nokulolekeshiwapo nga yaba mu mpangafye ya calo. Yonse aya mayanda yali nokulubulwa. Yonse aya mayanda kuti yalubulwa, kuti yabwelela ku bene mu mwaka walenga amakumi yasano uwakusefya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo abena Levi nabakwata insambu shakulubula amayanda yabo mu misumba yabo yonse iyo bapeelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico kanshi icuma ca mwina Levi cena calisuminishiwa ukucilubula, emukutila iŋanda iyashitishiwa mu musumba uuli onse untu bapeelwa ili nokubweseshiwa mu mwaka walenga amakumi yasano uwakusefya, pantu amayanda ayaba mu misumba ya bena Levi fyuma fyabo ifyaba pakati ka bana ba Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo incende shakucemenamo ifitekwa ishashinguluka imisumba yabo tashifwile kushitishiwa, pantu shena fyuma fyabo ifya pe na pe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
